# Source documents used for benchmarking stay out of the repository. They are
# operator-controlled engineering reports and may be confidential or subject to
# redistribution limits. A Modal function reads them by logical dataset ID from a
# pre-provisioned read-only Volume or CloudBucketMount; developer workstations and
# GitHub runners never upload or mount local report files.
*.pdf
*.docx
!tests/**/*.pdf
!tests/**/*.docx

# Raw benchmark output can contain recovered report text or model answers. It stays
# in cloud result storage. Only a sanitized aggregate summary may be attached to a
# GitHub Actions run or distilled into reviewed documentation.
docling_bench_result.json
docling_ocr_probe_result.json
ocr_comparison_result.json
qwen_vision_probe_result.json

# Per-machine tool permissions, not a project setting.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent skills are installed per machine as symlinks into .agents/, which is
# ignored; skills-lock.json is the tracked record of what to install.
.claude/skills/
